what's going on guys this is rob and  nathaniel is one of our largest  contributors on patreon specifically  he's part of the honor guard and as part  of the honor guard you get to request  your own beyond omega level video and  nathaniel requested parallax so we are  going to do beyond omega level parallax  now originally parallax was created by  ron mars and daryl banks and first  appeared in green lantern number 48 in  1994. now this version of parallax came  onto the scene in the midst of dc's  attempt to breathe new life into the  green lantern franchise by replacing hal  jordan who had basically been the green  lantern for nearly 40 years and they  sought to do this by replacing him with  a character named kyle raynor so after  hal's hometown of coast city is  destroyed by a super villain known as  mongol he basically goes crazy and then  kills all the green lantern cores and  becomes a super villain that calls  himself parallax now there is a little  more to this than that initially it  wasn't him just losing his mind and  going nuts i guess it kind of was but he  actually recreated the whole city and  the people in it using his green lantern  ring which was a violation of the green  lantern's policy and then he was  basically chastised for it and then  that's when he went crazy and started  calling himself parallax and so this  basically was the original concept of  the character of parallax to be an evil  version of hal jordan but when jeff  johns took over green lantern he  basically changed the character into an  ancient parasite that had been around  since the beginning of time when the  emotional spectrum was created now over  time each aspect of the emotional  spectrum gained sentience and spawned an  entity to embody it and these entities  each corresponded to a color which in  turn corresponds to one of the emotions  along the emotional spectrum so the  version of parallax introduced when jeff  johns literally reinvented the green  lantern mythos was basically the avatar  of the yellow portion of the emotional  spectrum and the physical manifestation  of fear throughout the universe and so  parallax we would learn came about when  the first insects found themselves  threatened by the first land-dwelling  animals after they evolved from the sea  creatures and therefore felt fear for  the very first time now the first insect  to actually feel fear would later on  become parallax but many years later he  would be captured by the guardians of  the universe and imprisoned for billions  of years within the central power  battery on owa a fact that the guardians  of the universe would keep secret out of  fear that someone would find out about  parallax and then try to free him and so  this is something we refer to as  foreshadowing we also found out during  this time that parallax which came to be  referred to as the yellow impurity was  responsible for the traditional weakness  of the green lantern core against the  color yellow which made a lot more sense  than just the idea that that specific  color would be immune to the power of  the green lantern ring which was  literally the idea back in like the 40s  and 50s it's just the color yellow so  presumably you could run up on the green  lantern with like a crayola crayon and  then stab him in the face and that's the  end of the green lantern  but once sinestro a former green lantern  that had betrayed the core and obtained  a yellow power ring from a planet called  cord that exists in the antimatter  universe once he was also imprisoned on  oah parallax was awakened and then  eventually freed from its confinement  and it would actually be this entity  that would influence hal jordan to turn  into a super villain now while possessed  by parallax how was able to cause the  entire justice league teen titans and  the justice society to basically become  crippled with fear and was only stopped  when the spirit of vengeance which had  once inhabited the specter separated the  entity which actually led to hal jordan  becoming the spectre for a while but  needing a new host parallax sought out  and possessed gampin one of the  guardians of the universe which is a  testament to just how powerful this guy  is it took the combined forces of five  green lanterns to remove parallax from  ganton and then return it to its prison  on owa now as for his powers parallax's  primary ability is that he can cause  others to feel immense fear to the point  that he can actually control their minds  and he has at various times controlled  beings as powerful as wonder woman  superman and even the spectre which is  widely regarded as the second most  powerful entity in the dc universe below  only the presence the dc universe's  supreme being basically got and  according to the specter parallax's  ability to instill fear in others is so  great that it caused entire  civilizations to collapse because  everybody was so paranoid now parallax  is also able to amp the power level of  any host he possesses and since this  ability is based on its ability to draw  on fear the level to which parallax can  increase its house powers is  theoretically limitless since there's  always an abundance of fear in the  universe now like members of the  sinestro corps or the yellow lantern  corps if you want to call on that  parallax can create hard light  constructs that are incredibly strong  and because parallax is a being of pure  energy it's impossible to deal physical  damage to the entity itself now parallax  is so powerful that during the time when  he was possessing hal jordan he had  designs on actually remaking the entire  universe and this took place during an  event known as zero hour crisis in time  which as you may have gathered from the  name was one of several crises that dc's  done throughout their history that are  actually used to reboot all or part of  the dc universe regardless this event  starts off with a villain called x-stand  which is actually hawk from hawk and  duff who we assume is the main villain  of the story now extant had gained  control over time and the entire  timeline of the dc universe was  basically coming apart but during the  course of the story we find out that the  one who's controlling things is actually  hal jordan under the influence of  parallax who's basically trying to  rewrite the timeline so that coast city  was never destroyed but we learned that  this is all just a small part of  parallax's plan as he reveals that  following his first encounter with the  other green lanterns that ended in his  defeat he realized he actually wanted to  remake the entire universe so to achieve  this he enters the time stream and  absorbs the chronal energy that was left  over from the first crisis on infinite  earth which makes him powerful enough to  seemingly erase almost everything in  existence in fact the superheroes that  survive indicate that he's responsible  for billions of deaths so it seems that  for a time at least he was actually able  to bring an end to almost everything in  existence now parallax informs the  heroes that he wants to create a more  perfect universe one free of all the  consequences of the shortcomings all of  them had had over the years and although  he is eventually defeated it takes the  combined forces of some of dc's most  powerful heroes including superman  captain adam dr fate two green lanterns  and even the spectre to defeat this guy  so that fact alone places parallax well  beyond omega level which isn't  surprising because any time dc sets up  one of its crisis events we can pretty  much be sure that whoever the big bad of  that event happens to be is going to be  extremely powerful because they threaten  the existence of the entire universe and  parallax really came close to destroying  a universe and remaking it according to  his own will i mean technically he did  blink it out of existence and then bring  it back which is kind of how they use  zero hour to fix a lot of the problems  from crisis uninvited earth but  regardless he's definitely one of the  most powerful beings in the dc universe  but with that being said guys we're  gonna bring this to an end thank you  again nathaniel for being a member of  the honor guard on patreon and i will  catch you all later  peace
 

